{"id":"cg-10","clusterId":"code-gen","prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"EVAL: cg-10\nImplement `fizzbuzz(n)` returning an array of strings for 1..n ('Fizz'/'Buzz'/'FizzBuzz' rules, else the number as a string).\n\nRespond with ONLY the JavaScript function source, no markdown fences, no explanation."}],"reference":"function fizzbuzz(n) {\n  const out = [];\n  for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n    if (i % 15 === 0) out.push('FizzBuzz');\n    else if (i % 3 === 0) out.push('Fizz');\n    else if (i % 5 === 0) out.push('Buzz');\n    else out.push(String(i));\n  }\n  return out;\n}","scoring":{"kind":"code-exec","language":"javascript","tests":"test('first five', () => assertDeepEqual(fizzbuzz(5), ['1', '2', 'Fizz', '4', 'Buzz']));\ntest('fifteen', () => assert(fizzbuzz(15)[14] === 'FizzBuzz'));"}}
{"id":"cg-11","clusterId":"code-gen","prompt":[{"role":"user","content":"EVAL: cg-11\nImplement `fibonacci(n)` returning the n-th Fibonacci number (fib(0)=0, fib(1)=1).\n\nRespond with ONLY the JavaScript function source, no markdown fences, no explanation."}],"reference":"function fibonacci(n) {\n  let a = 0, b = 1;\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    const t = a + b;\n    a = b;\n    b = t;\n  }\n  return a;\n}","scoring":{"kind":"code-exec","language":"javascript","tests":"test('ten', () => assert(fibonacci(10) === 55));\ntest('zero', () => assert(fibonacci(0) === 0));"}}
